  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "**GIVEN:**\n\n4/5 + (-3/10) = x + 1(1)/(2) \n\n**CALCULATION:**\n\nHere, we have 4/5 + (-3/10) = x + 1(1)/(2)\n\n⇒ 5/10 = x + 3/2 \n\n⇒ 1/2 = x + 3/2 \n\n⇒ x = (1/2 - 3/2) = -2/2 = -1.\n\n**Hence, the required value is -1.**",
